// botFollowerTryResolveHop(player, fromNode, toNode) - PathFollower.TryResolveHop:
// which edge this follower would steer for a hop of the route it is carrying
// (botFollowerTryFindEdge, in public, so a harness cannot answer the question
// a second way). Returns the edge row, or -1.
return botFollowerTryFindEdge(argument0, argument1, argument2);
